            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">The data represent a typical miniature RF chip type inductor, used in the information and communication technology. Material data are taken from datasheets of producers of such inductors. Infrastructure and production efforts are based on own assumptions. The dataset represents 1 kg of inductors with a weight of 16.8 miligram/unit. No major updates were made in 2023 - according to recent product sheets from manufacturers, the composition of inductors remains similar. Production efforts dataset is update in a separate module. It is assumed that only global primary metals are used in the inventory.; UUID: 68f54908-8f28-3591-b30d-8c9fd230bb8f</common:generalComment>
        </dataSetInformation>
